# WKC Treasury — 13-Week Cashflow Forecasting POC v3

## Local Development
```
npm install
npm run dev
```
Open http://localhost:5173

## Build for Production
```
npm install
npm run build
```
Output goes to `/dist` folder.

## Azure Static Web Apps Deployment
1. Push this repo to GitHub
2. Go to Azure Portal → Create Resource → Static Web App
3. Connect to your GitHub repo
4. Build settings:
   - App location: `/`
   - Output location: `dist`
5. Azure will auto-deploy on every push to main

## Features
- 13-week rolling cashflow forecast
- Aviation / Marine / Land segments
- Americas + Europe/ARA regions  
- 3-tier model: Confirmed / Expected / Scenario Adjusted
- 8 disruption scenarios + 3 upside scenarios
- Macro market signals (Brent, OPEC+, Crack Spreads, PMI, ATI)
- Save and compare scenario combos
- RCF utilisation tracker
